                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Warrior crewmen are armed with broadswords, javelins, and either a longbow, or shield. Warrior crewmen longbows may be replaced with bows +6 pts per chariot. Heavy chariot crew may have light armour +8 pts per chariot. Heavy chariots: four or more horses, an unarmed driver, and two warriors armed as above. They count as Heavy Chariots and cause D3 Strength 4 impact hits. The chariot has a 5+ save, and may be increased to a 3+ save with shields and light armour. A Mauryan heavy chariot may have barding +16 pts (maximum save 2+, Movement 5"); in the Mauryan list only a 0-1 Heavy chariot unit may have barding. Replaced by Large Chariots in the Classical Indian list. (Alexander the Great p.109)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <infoLinks>
            <infoLink id="c430-0eb1-fb08-a062" name="Chariots" hidden="false" targetId="7637-c605-27c5-0aab" type="rule"/>
            <infoLink id="5592-1617-72cc-27d3" name="Hand Weapon" hidden="false" targetId="a423-b782-e1ce-43e2" type="profile"/>
            <infoLink id="b3c4-e81e-ff63-3d63" name="Javelin" hidden="false" targetId="10ef-3567-0d3f-d9e7" type="profile"/>
            <infoLink id="be9b-0bb9-5a8a-c480" name="Long Bow" hidden="false" targetId="8fb0-c5a6-7a18-ea82" type="profile"/>
            <infoLink id="79da-b5f7-e215-544b" name="Light Armour" hidden="true" targetId="e1d7-1cd3-1431-4862" type="profile">
              <modifiers>
                <!-- profile-swap -->
                <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="false">
