            <profile id="b7b5-c6c8-e22e-f00a" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="0641-2ee1-c462-c414" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Broadsword, javelins, and shield. May replace broadswords with double handed weapons (includes clubs and maces) +2 pts. Skirmishers. Elephant and Chariot escorts: one unit of escorts is allowed for each chariot unit or elephant in the army. Each elephant escort unit may have up to eight escorts, each chariot or wagon escort unit up to four escorts per chariot or wagon in the unit (not enforced). (Alexander the Great p.110)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
