              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Light Bolt Thrower (ballista): Range 36", Strength 4/-1 per rank, no save, D3 wounds per hit. Each machine has a crew of two men armed with broadsword. Up to one war machine is allowed for each bodyguard, hereditary or mercenary infantry unit in the army. War machines may be grouped in batteries of up to three models. Classical, Mountain and Republican lists: war machines (other than the Rathamasaula) only in sieges. (Alexander the Great p.110)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <costs>
            <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="40"/>
          </costs>
        </selectionEntry>
